{"id":73,"title":{"rendered":"१३. हनुमान चालीसा"},"slug":"hanumanchalisa","date":"2017-05-09T05:22:52","isNew":true,"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"ramayan-kand-container space-y-4\">\n    <blockquote class=\"my-4 p-4 border-l-4 border-amber-600 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-xl text-center font-heading\">\n      <strong class=\"text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">॥ श्री हनुमान चालीसा ॥</strong><br/>\n      <span class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">गोस्वामी तुलसीदास रचित चालीस चौपाइयाँ एवं दोहे</span>\n    </blockquote>\n  \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/10 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border border-amber-600/40 my-4 space-y-2 shadow-sm\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center\">॥ दोहा ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose font-bold text-center\">श्रीगुरु चरन सरोज रज निज मनु मुकुरु सुधारि ।<br/>बरनउँ रघुबर बिमल जसु जो दायकु फल चारि ॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/10 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border border-amber-600/40 my-4 space-y-2 shadow-sm\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center\">॥ दोहा ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose font-bold text-center\">बुद्धिहीन तनु जानिके सुमिरौं पवन-कुमार ।<br/>बल बुधि बिद्या देहु मोहिं हरहु कलेस बिकार ॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">जय हनुमान ज्ञान गुन सागर ।<br/>जय कपीस तिहुँ लोक उजागर ॥१॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">राम दूत अतुलित बल धामा ।<br/>अञ्जनि-पुत्र पवनसुत नामा ॥२॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">महाबीर बिक्रम बजरङ्गी ।<br/>कुमति निवार सुमति के सङ्गी ॥३॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">कञ्चन बरन बिराज सुबेसा ।<br/>कानन कुण्डल कुञ्चित केसा ॥४॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">हाथ बज्र औ ध्वजा बिराजै ।<br/>काँधे मूँज जनेउ साजै ॥५॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">सङ्कर सुवन केसरीनन्दन ।<br/>तेज प्रताप महा जग बन्दन ॥६॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">बिद्यावान गुनी अति चातुर ।<br/>राम काज करिबे को आतुर ॥७॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">प्रभु चरित्र सुनिबे को रसिया ।<br/>राम लखन सीता मन बसिया ॥८॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">सूक्ष्म रूप धरि सियहिं दिखावा ।<br/>बिकट रूप धरि लङ्क जरावा ॥९॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">भीम रूप धरि असुर सँहारे ।<br/>रामचन्द्र के काज सँवारे ॥१०॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">लाय सञ्जीवन लखन जियाये ।<br/>श्रीरघुबीर हरषि उर लाये ॥११॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">रघुपति कीह्नी बहुत बड़ाई ।<br/>तुम मम प्रिय भरतहि सम भाई ॥१२॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">सहस बदन तुह्मारो जस गावैं ।<br/>अस कहि श्रीपति कण्ठ लगावैं ॥१३॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">सनकादिक ब्रह्मादि मुनीसा ।<br/>नारद सारद सहित अहीसा ॥१४॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">जम कुबेर दिगपाल जहाँ ते ।<br/>कबि कोबिद कहि सके कहाँ ते ॥१५॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">तुम उपकार सुग्रीवहिं कीह्ना ।<br/>राम मिलाय राज पद दीह्ना ॥१६॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">तुह्मरो मन्त्र बिभीषन माना ।<br/>लङ्केस्वर भए सब जग जाना ॥१७॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">जुग सहस्र जोजन पर भानु ।<br/>लील्यो ताहि मधुर फल जानू ॥१८॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">प्रभु मुद्रिका मेलि मुख माहीं ।<br/>जलधि लाँघि गये अचरज नाहीं ॥१९॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">दुर्गम काज जगत के जेते ।<br/>सुगम अनुग्रह तुह्मरे तेते ॥२०॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">राम दुआरे तुम रखवारे ।<br/>होत न आज्ञा बिनु पैसारे ॥२१॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">सब सुख लहै तुह्मारी सरना ।<br/>तुम रच्छक काहू को डर ना ॥२२॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">आपन तेज सह्मारो आपै ।<br/>तीनों लोक हाँक तें काँपै ॥२३॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">भूत पिसाच निकट नहिं आवै ।<br/>महाबीर जब नाम सुनावै ॥२४॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">नासै रोग हरै सब पीरा ।<br/>जपत निरन्तर हनुमत बीरा ॥२५॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">सङ्कट तें हनुमान छुड़ावै ।<br/>मन क्रम बचन ध्यान जो लावै ॥२६॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">सब पर राम तपस्वी राजा ।<br/>तिन के काज सकल तुम साजा ॥२७॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">और मनोरथ जो कोई लावै ।<br/>सोई अमित जीवन फल पावै ॥२८॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">चारों जुग परताप तुह्मारा ।<br/>है परसिद्ध जगत उजियारा ॥२९॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">साधु सन्त के तुम रखवारे ।<br/>असुर निकन्दन राम दुलारे ॥३०॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">अष्टसिद्धि नौ निधि के दाता ।<br/>अस बर दीन जानकी माता ॥३१॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">राम रसायन तुह्मरे पासा ।<br/>सदा रहो रघुपति के दासा ॥३२॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">तुह्मरे भजन राम को पावै ।<br/>जनम जनम के दुख बिसरावै ॥३३॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">अन्त काल रघुबर पुर जाई ।<br/>जहाँ जन्म हरिभक्त कहाई ॥३४॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">और देवता चित्त न धरई ।<br/>हनुमत सेइ सर्ब सुख करई ॥३५॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">सङ्कट कटै मिटै सब पीरा ।<br/>जो सुमिरै हनुमत बलबीरा ॥३६॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">जय जय जय हनुमान गोसाईं ।<br/>कृपा करहु गुरुदेव की नाईं ॥३७॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">जो सत बार पाठ कर कोई ।<br/>छूटहि बन्दि महा सुख होई ॥३८॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">जो यह पढ़ै हनुमान चालीसा ।<br/>होय सिद्धि साखी गौरीसा ॥३९॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/5 p-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 my-3 space-y-2\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center text-sm\">॥ चौपाई ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose text-center\">तुलसीदास सदा हरि चेरा ।<br/>कीजै नाथ हृदय महँ डेरा ॥४०॥</p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"verse-block bg-amber-500/10 p-4 rounded-xl border-l-4 border border-amber-600/40 my-4 space-y-2 shadow-sm\">\n          <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 font-heading text-center\">॥ दोहा ॥</p>\n          <p class=\"font-devanagari leading-loose font-bold text-center\">पवनतनय सङ्कट हरन मङ्गल मूरति रूप ।<br/>राम लखन सीता सहित हृदय बसहु सुर भूप ॥</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>"}}